WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,360
How could it be higher?

2
00:00:01,360 --> 00:00:03,240
Are you still my boss’s college roommate?

3
00:00:03,240 --> 00:00:04,560
Can the boss not value you?

4
00:00:04,560 --> 00:00:06,680
Be the boss and become the world's richest man

5
00:00:06,680 --> 00:00:08,280
You will also lift all boats as the tide rises

6
00:00:08,280 --> 00:00:09,560
People who follow the boss

7
00:00:09,560 --> 00:00:10,720
Who is not a rich man?

8
00:00:10,720 --> 00:00:12,480
That’s how good I am

9
00:00:12,480 --> 00:00:13,680
Just because I have a good brother

10
00:00:13,680 --> 00:00:15,480
It was Zhang Tong who changed my destiny

11
00:00:15,480 --> 00:00:17,040
You also like to bounce off walls

12
00:00:17,040 --> 00:00:18,200
Don't know

13
00:00:18,200 --> 00:00:19,520
Now I'm a little confused

14
00:00:19,520 --> 00:00:21,520
My brain is a mess

15
00:00:21,520 --> 00:00:23,740
Feelings cannot be just temporary passion

16
00:00:23,740 --> 00:00:25,740
It’s not like I’m testing you to think clearly first.

17
00:00:25,740 --> 00:00:27,340
Don't make decisions when your brain gets hot.

18
00:00:27,340 --> 00:00:29,500
The others are all colleagues who are here to fight hard.

19
00:00:29,540 --> 00:00:31,460
Put business before private in the company

20
00:00:31,460 --> 00:00:33,980
Let’s wait until we understand each other about emotional matters.

21
00:00:33,980 --> 00:00:35,180
I'm afraid they'll lie

22
00:00:35,180 --> 00:00:36,700
In fact, I already have a boyfriend

23
00:00:36,700 --> 00:00:37,740
Are you single?

24
00:00:37,740 --> 00:00:38,780
Are you willing to date

25
00:00:38,780 --> 00:00:40,300
It’s everyone else’s freedom

26
00:00:40,300 --> 00:00:42,250
Feelings are two-way

27
00:00:42,250 --> 00:00:44,690
What you want is the person you want to stay with for the rest of your life.

28
00:00:44,690 --> 00:00:47,250
rather than temporarily

29
00:00:47,250 --> 00:00:48,430
Makes sense

30
00:00:48,430 --> 00:00:49,710
I'll do my job first

31
00:00:49,710 --> 00:00:51,540
Also respect their choices

32
00:00:51,540 --> 00:00:54,460
You are only twenty-two years old and you are so young. Why are you so anxious?
